  ○ [p1_t1] Create FastAPI Backend
    agent:  Backend Developer (programmer_1)
    desc:   Create a complete FastAPI backend in /Users/shenweizhang/Desktop/ai/run_test_004/backend with:

1. Python virtual environment (venv) setup
2. requirements.txt with: fastapi, uvicorn, sqlalchemy, pydantic
3. main.py - FastAPI app with CORS
4. database.py - SQLite setup with SQLAlchemy
5. models.py - Database models:
   - Category: id, name, type (income/expense), parent_id (nullable for subcategories), icon (optional), is_preset (boolean)
   - Transaction: id, category_id (FK), amount (float), date (date), note (text), created_at
   - Budget: id, category_id (FK, unique per category), month (string YYYY-MM), amount (float)
6. schemas.py - Pydantic models for request/response
7. routes/ directory with:
   - categories.py: CRUD for categories. Pre-seed: Income/Expense as parents, Expense children: 餐饮/交通/购物/娱乐/居住/医疗/教育/其他
   - transactions.py: CRUD with pagination, month filtering (YYYY-MM), sorting by date desc
   - budgets.py: CRUD per category per month, check if over budget
   - dashboard.py: monthly summary (total income/expense/balance), expense breakdown by category for pie chart, last 6 months trend data
8. seed.py - Script to pre-populate default categories

Write ALL files completely. Use proper error handling, HTTP status codes, and validation.
  ○ [p2_t1] Create Next.js Frontend
    agent:  Frontend Developer (programmer_2)
    desc:   Create a complete Next.js (App Router) frontend in /Users/shenweizhang/Desktop/ai/run_test_004/frontend with:

1. Initialize with: npx create-next-app@latest frontend --typescript --tailwind --eslint --app --src-dir --no-import-alias --use-npm
2. Install Shadcn UI: npx shadcn@latest init -d --force
3. Add Shadcn components: npx shadcn@latest add button card input select table badge dialog toast separator -y
4. Install recharts: npm install recharts
5. Install lucide-react: Already included with shadcn
6. Create lib/utils.ts for cn() helper

Create these pages and components (ALL must fetch data from http://localhost:8000):

7. src/app/layout.tsx - Root layout with Sidebar navigation (分类管理, 交易记录, 月度概览, 预算管理)
8. src/app/page.tsx - Redirect to /dashboard

9. Dashboard page (src/app/dashboard/page.tsx):
   - 3 info cards: 当月总收入, 当月总支出, 结余
   - Pie chart of expense by category (Recharts PieChart)
   - Line chart of last 6 months income/expense trend (Recharts LineChart)
   - Fetch from /api/dashboard/overview

10. Categories page (src/app/categories/page.tsx):
    - Table listing all categories with name, type, actions
    - Add/Edit dialog modal
    - Delete with confirmation
    - Fetch from /api/categories

11. Transactions page (src/app/transactions/page.tsx):
    - Table with date, category, amount, note, actions
    - Add/Edit dialog with category dropdown, amount, date picker, note
    - Month filter (YYYY-MM)
    - Pagination controls
    - Fetch from /api/transactions

12. Budgets page (src/app/budgets/page.tsx):
    - List all expense categories with monthly budget
    - Edit budget amount
    - Show warning/alert when exceeded (compare actual vs budget)
    - Month selector
    - Fetch from /api/budgets and /api/budgets/status?month=YYYY-MM

13. Add a env.local.js or update .env with NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8000

All UI should be Chinese language. Use consistent styling with Shadcn. All data fetching with proper loading and error states.
